Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要上马拉松式电视节目{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They're doing this telethon thing on TV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我的经纪人帮我争取当主持人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And my agent got me a job as co-host!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}太棒了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}帮公视做好事  又能增加曝光率{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}A little good deed for PBS, plus some TV exposure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.58,0:03:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我乔伊最爱做这种美事了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's the kind of math Joey likes to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}公视啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, PBS!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.34,0:03:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}公视哪里不对了  他们哪里对{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What's wrong with PBS? What's right with them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你为何不喜欢公视{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why don't you like PBS?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.64,0:03:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}因为我妈自杀之后  我孤苦伶仃非常难过{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, 'cause right after my mom killed herself,I was just in this really bad place, you know, personally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.23,0:03:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}所以我想写信给《芝麻街》  心情应该会好一点{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So I just thought it would make me feel better if I wrote to Sesame Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}因为我小时候  总觉得他们很亲切{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Because they were so nice when I was a little kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}结果根本没人回信{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No one ever wrote back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.24,0:03:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那些布偶根本没有手指  写不了信{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well y'know a lot of those Muppets don't have thumbs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我只收到一个烂钥匙环  拜托  我那时住在纸箱里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All I got was a lousy key chain! And by that time I was living in a box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.37,0:03:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}连钥匙都没有{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I didn't have keys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.21,0:03:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我很遗憾  菲比  我只是{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm sorry, Pheebs.I just wanted to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}想做好事  就像你帮忙生小孩{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}do a good deed, like you did with the babies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你才不是做善事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}This isn't a good deed.{\r}
